# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `frontend/`, which is self-contained.
# Everything below is irrelevant to the Next.js build and only bloats the upload.
target
.cargo
Cargo.lock
Cargo.toml
contracts
backend
maker-sdk
scripts
.git
*.md

# Local env files: Vercel project settings are the source of truth for deploys
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
